  "contentHtml": "\n<div><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n <w:WordDocument>\n <w:View>Normal</w:View>\n <w:Zoom>0</w:Zoom>\n <w:PunctuationKerning/>\n <w:ValidateAgainstSchemas/>\n <w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>false</w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>\n <w:IgnoreMixedContent>false</w:IgnoreMixedContent>\n <w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>false</w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>\n <w:Compatibility>\n <w:BreakWrappedTables/>\n <w:SnapToGridInCell/>\n <w:WrapTextWithPunct/>\n <w:UseAsianBreakRules/>\n <w:DontGrowAutofit/>\n </w:Compatibility>\n <w:BrowserLevel>MicrosoftInternetExplorer4</w:BrowserLevel>\n </w:WordDocument>\n</xml><![endif]-->\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/83327400.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s83327400.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\">Монголын 10 сүнстэй газарын тухай урд нь оруулж байсныг хүмүүс санаж байгаа байх. Харин одоо Америкийн 10 сүнстэй гэх газруудын зургийг нэртэй нь оруулж байна. Хэрэв та сүнс хий үзэгдэлтэй аймшгийн газруудаар аялахыг хүсдэг бол бас та АМЕРИК-т амьдардаг бол очоод үзэхэд сонирхолтой байх болов уу. Зарим нь аймшгийн кинонуудын зураг авалтыг хийсэн газрууд байх юм. <br></span></p><p><strong>Ruby, Arizona</strong><br><span lang=\"EN\"></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/83327400.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s83327400.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--></span></p><p><br><strong>Bodie, California</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/49754055.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s49754055.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--></span></p><p><br><strong>Centralia, Pennsylvania</strong></p><p>Энэ газрыг Virginia гэж SILENT HILL кинон дээр гардаг ч гэлээ уг зураг авалтыг нь Centralia, Pennsylvania-д авсан юм. Хэрэв та очиж үзэх юм бол таныг яг кинон дээр гардаг шиг өтгөн манантай газар угтах болно.<strong><br></strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/72846225.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s72846225.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--></span></p><p><strong>Flagstaff, Maine</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/74021194.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s74021194.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--></span></p><p><strong>Virginia City, Montana</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/26414903.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s26414903.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG5--></span></p><p><strong>Cahawba, Alabama</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG6--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/19634041.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s19634041.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG6--></span></p><p><strong>Rhyolite, Nevada</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/59676608.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s59676608.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--></span></p><p><strong>Glenrio, Texas/New Mexico</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG8--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/16517933.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s16517933.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG8--></span></p><p><strong>Goldfield, Arizona</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG9--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/68115291.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s68115291.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG9--></span></p><p><strong>Gleeson, Courtland and Pearce, Arizona</strong></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN\"><!--IMG10--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/25130134.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121201135208im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/39/s25130134.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG10--></span></p>\n\n<!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n <w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\" LatentStyleCount=\"156\">\n </w:LatentStyles>\n</xml><![endif]--><!--[if gte mso 10]>\n<style>\n /* Style Definitions */\n table.MsoNormalTable\n {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\";\n mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;\n mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;\n mso-style-noshow:yes;\n mso-style-parent:\"\";\n mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\n mso-para-margin:0in;\n mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt;\n mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\n font-size:10.0pt;\n font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\n mso-ansi-language:#0400;\n mso-fareast-language:#0400;\n mso-bidi-language:#0400;}\n</style>\n<![endif]--></div>\n",
